{"file": "狩猎86，兴安岭猎人传-第58集.mp4", "ep": 58, "duration": 94.4, "segments": [{"start": 2.19, "end": 3.11, "text": "我现在是知道"}, {"start": 3.11, "end": 4.11, "text": "为啥你爹要把这狗"}, {"start": 4.11, "end": 5.07, "text": "训得这么怂了"}, {"start": 5.59, "end": 7.15, "text": "感情是知道他有多厉害"}, {"start": 7.15, "end": 8.03, "text": "宝贝着呢"}, {"start": 8.31, "end": 8.87, "text": "行了"}, {"start": 8.87, "end": 9.87, "text": "咱继续下一场"}, {"start": 15.94, "end": 16.78, "text": "达斗方面"}, {"start": 16.78, "end": 17.78, "text": "他从未输过"}, {"start": 17.94, "end": 18.58, "text": "兄弟"}, {"start": 18.58, "end": 20.02, "text": "你现在认输还来得及"}, {"start": 22.94, "end": 23.7, "text": "我认输"}, {"start": 24.66, "end": 25.26, "text": "啥"}, {"start": 25.98, "end": 26.94, "text": "我说我认输"}, {"start": 27.18, "end": 28.58, "text": "大黄打不过这萌奥"}, {"start": 28.9, "end": 30.1, "text": "不过三局两胜"}, {"start": 30.1, "end": 31.14, "text": "还是我赢了吧"}, {"start": 33.04, "end": 33.64, "text": "行"}, {"start": 33.64, "end": 34.52, "text": "虎子兄弟"}, {"start": 34.52, "end": 35.56, "text": "今天是我输了"}, {"start": 35.56, "end": 36.44, "text": "愿赌服输"}, {"start": 36.44, "end": 37.8, "text": "给你双份撞过狗粮"}, {"start": 37.8, "end": 38.52, "text": "虎子"}, {"start": 38.8, "end": 39.72, "text": "这狗你卖不"}, {"start": 39.72, "end": 40.64, "text": "我出一千"}, {"start": 40.92, "end": 41.48, "text": "不卖"}, {"start": 43.05, "end": 43.77, "text": "那"}, {"start": 43.97, "end": 45.37, "text": "租你家大黄配某一天"}, {"start": 45.57, "end": 46.25, "text": "二百块"}, {"start": 48.61, "end": 49.13, "text": "潘哥"}, {"start": 49.13, "end": 50.37, "text": "这不是钱的事"}, {"start": 50.37, "end": 51.17, "text": "这事吧"}, {"start": 51.17, "end": 51.85, "text": "五百"}, {"start": 51.85, "end": 52.65, "text": "就配一天"}, {"start": 52.85, "end": 53.62, "text": "成交"}, {"start": 54.17, "end": 54.65, "text": "走"}, {"start": 54.77, "end": 55.45, "text": "喝一杯"}, {"start": 55.61, "end": 56.69, "text": "涮羊肉我备好了"}, {"start": 56.97, "end": 57.97, "text": "你那大黄的事"}, {"start": 57.97, "end": 58.69, "text": "我这有要"}, {"start": 58.69, "end": 60.01, "text": "保证他预献预死"}, {"start": 62.95, "end": 63.63, "text": "大黄"}, {"start": 63.63, "end": 64.95, "text": "你先随便对付一口"}, {"start": 64.95, "end": 66.07, "text": "我俩进屋喝点"}, {"start": 68.43, "end": 69.11, "text": "大黄"}, {"start": 69.47, "end": 70.27, "text": "别怪我"}, {"start": 71.22, "end": 72.34, "text": "牺牲你一个"}, {"start": 72.66, "end": 73.9, "text": "幸福老马家"}, {"start": 75.33, "end": 76.73, "text": "不是我不心疼你"}, {"start": 77.13, "end": 79.01, "text": "是他给的实在太多了"}]}